  <item>
    <title>EP64：从张雪聊起，“被看见”应该是努力的一部分吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a158816ff7b9a8c0a5b835d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a158816ff7b9a8c0a5b835d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>出身农村、初中毕业、从摩托车修理工到创造张雪机车，似乎张雪的每一次人生转折都源于一次“被看见”。但“被看见”究竟是努力的奖励，还是努力本身就该包含的一部分？今天四位老友就结合生活中形形色色的故事，咱们一起聊聊，努力与主动展示之间的边界与选择。</span></p><p></p><p><span>shownotes：</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a></span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong><span> 从张雪追车事件聊起——被看见是努力的奖励，还是努力本身就该包含的一部分？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="279">04:39</a></span></strong><strong><span>  </span></strong><span>你有努力羞耻吗？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="279">04:39</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">07:47</a></span></strong><strong><span>  </span></strong><span>如何看待张雪式的极致努力？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">07:47</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a></span></strong><strong><span>  </span></strong><span>主动展示 vs "死皮赖脸"：从电视台怪人逻辑到盲目自信的价值，原来</span><strong><span>被看见的第一步是看不见</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1359">22:39</a></span></strong><strong><span>  </span></strong><span>推销还是推荐？那些被看见的方式与边界</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1359">22:39</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1772">29:32</a></span></strong><strong><span>  </span></strong><span>职场中的被看见（内含：衣服姐偷摸儿当上领导秘籍）</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1772">29:32</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2325">38:45</a></span></strong><strong><span>  </span></strong><span>朋友圈表演式努力大赏，我们为啥一边嗤之以鼻，一边还要演？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2325">38:45</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2843">47:23</a></span></strong><strong><span>  </span></strong><span>30+的我们，还需要被看见吗？希望被谁看见？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2843">47:23</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3143">52:23</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>尽管努力的谐音是奴隶，但</span><strong><span>每个人都值得被看见——大大方方的、我们都是主角！</span></strong></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><span>恭喜你呀！</span></p><p><span>从今天起拥有了四位电子老铁，我们想做你的「funny friends」</span></p><p><span>让我们一起发现生活有意思！</span></p><p></p><p><span>欢迎订阅支持我们哦😉</span></p><p><span>（ps想听东北人er唠的话题也可以留言呀）</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
