  <item>
    <title>EP62：全裸的大东北</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69afc8a52a2882aae74752a4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69afc8a52a2882aae74752a4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>副标题：《从东北澡堂看东北文化》</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢追更全新改版后的最新一期，作为四位东北老友，做足了功课希望带你亲身体验一把，什么是“全裸的大东北”！（以下shownotes是AIGC）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a>：本期为改版后全新一期，聚焦东北澡堂，作为反映东北人文与东北人特性的核心场景，发起文化探索。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="211">03:31</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a>：喵总分享东北女生澡堂 “拍奶” 服务细节，对比男女浴区搓澡、敲背流程及师傅称谓差异。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">08:46</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a>：女浴区多聊具体八卦，男浴区多 “吹牛” 彰显社会地位，源于男女去澡堂的关系差异。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1001">16:41</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1237">20:37</a>：采访长辈，讲述 60-90 年代东北澡堂的简陋环境（黑黢燎光、单池轮换、无淋浴）及洗浴用品。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">24:44</a>：东东梳理澡堂从闯关东时期到 2000 年后的四个阶段，从刚需公益向市场化休闲综合体转变。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2052">34:12</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2495">41:35</a>：分享南方人初闯东北澡堂的尴尬状态，解析南北洗浴频率、方式差异的根源（气候、环境）。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2588">43:08</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2981">49:41</a>：探讨东北澡堂承载的东北人韧性、豪爽、赤诚的精神特质，是东北人的精神故乡。</span></p><span></span><p><span>东北澡堂影响了东北人的一生：全裸的大东北，热气腾腾</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/667d3d24c13b46d76c471880/lg0AkxSo7ritsGaIYm8nizBhZUjD.m4a" length="51963247" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fivf-AifBMXCKS3_Dj4zmqSctiL7.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
