  <item>
    <title>EP57:播客主播颜值坦白局</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6919ed35cbba038b42d19d31</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6919ed35cbba038b42d19d31</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 22 Nov 2025 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天，我们必须坦诚布公地聊聊：</span><strong><span>颜值，到底是不是一张万能牌？它怎么影响了我们的运气和机会？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>PART I</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 播客主播颜值评分 坦白，值不值得相信啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">09:59</a>主播相互形容颜值细节</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm-Yy0gDCKNhbWmNT791jtOA6m0U.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoeIXprElVmXQzmyf85Nr0gK2SBW.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpfZaDFYhvFchPhwkpkPecQSLFU9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvI5YXBBCdonjDVcq1_CeIIN1QXR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>PART 2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a>是否享受过颜值红利or吃亏？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a> 任何一个优点叠加颜值都能吃到红利</span></p><span></span><p><span>PART3</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1652">27:32</a> 专业能力和颜值的关系是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> 审美还是审丑我们自己重新定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2013">33:33</a> 颜值门槛有什么？哪些极力打咩？</span></p><span></span><p><span>PART4</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2187">36:27</a> 颜值什么部分会影响运势呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>评论区 回复：</span><strong><span>#你身边“颜值与实力反差最大”的朋友的故事# 与我们互动&nbsp;</span></strong></p>]]></description>
