  <item>
    <title>EP56：贱人何止矫情！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691774136018cc2c98e2f610</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">691774136018cc2c98e2f610</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Nov 2025 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>有人的地方就有江湖，有江湖的地方就有“贱人”。而有“贱人”的地方就必定有奋力对抗“贱人”的战士们……</span></p><span></span><p><span>shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">03:32</a> 职场里有真笑的人吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 这个世界上究竟有多少【蛐蛐精】、【酸葡萄王】以及【装傻充愣第一名】？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">08:14</a> 这个世界上没有无目的贱人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">09:43</a> 谁没被【绿茶】绿过呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 贱人的底层逻辑就是【略施演技 损人利己】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="668">11:08</a> 复盘会开成大型综艺现场—《演员请就位》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 【熟贱】能抵，【陌贱】难防</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> 有上方授权的【宝贱】当真功力强劲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 当【宝贱】的【上方】闪亮登场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">20:03</a> 【偷盗贱人】自有天收</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1277">21:17</a> 跟着宋慧乔学习【报复贱人 十年不晚】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1361">22:41</a> 在贱人面前当一个傻子多么好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> 太全了！《职场贱人图鉴》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1738">28:58</a> 职场里只有两种人：贱人和自己人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">31:55</a> 天下无贱----从我做起！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们要相信贱人注定会活成一个笑话，而被贱人困扰的你却值得更广阔的人生！</span></p><span></span><p><span>友点意思祝所有听众不再遇贱！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/667d3d24c13b46d76c471880/lkFT4kVPrs-AmJ3QmP19zMxQO0_l.m4a" length="75771019" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlEI1WSQsvsF0YeWqgbN5rlLKLkY.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP55:我的心情——明码标价！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690e9dd2af4fc00da7ae717f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">690e9dd2af4fc00da7ae717f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Nov 2025 01:34:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从续命奶茶到说走就走的旅行，当花钱不再只为满足衣食住行，而用来买一种现代最稀缺的资源——好情绪，我们的钱包和内心，谁才是赢家？四位老友组织了一场情绪消费的表彰兼吐槽大会，一起盘一盘那些为情绪买单的瞬间，分享“人间值得”与“智商税”背后的故事。</span><br><span></span></p><span></span><p><span>show notes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">03:42</a> 抛开实用考量，细数那些让我们笑出声的情绪消费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="284">04:44</a> 小商品市场挖宝，嘘，一般人我不告诉他</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="507">08:27</a> 喵总0元体验高端美容院，是骗局还是情绪羊毛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="844">14:04</a> “十五的月亮十六圆，十六的月饼卖两元”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">16:18</a> 品牌高卡会员，真有福利也真把你绑的死死的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">20:02</a> 花钱买“抽离”，让好心情飞一会儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">23:23</a> 24小时不间断充沛情绪价值供给，只有它～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> 物品不会说话，却默默陪伴见证了我们的人生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1705">28:25</a> 智商税？那些让我们肉疼的情绪消费陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">31:08</a> 喵总的iphone初体验，小偷情绪价值拉满了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1952">32:32</a> 我们都曾是“未来幻想式消费”的拥簇者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2224">37:04</a> 情绪消费到底值不值？消费之前，记得给自己泼一盆冷水</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2464">41:04</a> 当我们为情绪消费，真正想买的到底是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>恭喜你呀！</span></p><span></span><p><span>从今天起拥有了四位电子老铁，我们想做你的「funny friends」</span></p><span></span><p><span>每周六，我们一起发现生活有意思！</span></p><span></span><p><span>新播上线，喜欢的话欢迎订阅支持我们😉</span></p><span></span><p><span>（ps想听东北人er唠的话题也可以留言呀）</span></p>]]></description>
